golf tee with a bolt action target pistol and a Senator getting it in the heart at 550 yards on her own patio with a Mosin-Nagant and a budget 3x9 scope. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5108038412375204384/comments/default/5792756270471083959'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5108038412375204384/comments/default/5792756270471083959'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/for-you-hunters-out-there.html?showComment=1473813601387#c5792756270471083959' title=''/><author><name>FedUp</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/for-you-hunters-out-there.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5108038412375204384' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/5108038412375204384' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1912195453"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2016 at 7:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-4851363231533691474</id><published>2016-09-12T11:05:19.913-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T11:05:19.913-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Many collectivist-hating, second amendment advocat...</title><content type='html'>Many collectivist-hating, second amendment advocate Republicans also live in the affluent neighborhoods described above.  So be careful who you make a target.  You might be targeting one of our own! &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Old Greybeard</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5108038412375204384/comments/default/4851363231533691474'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/5108038412375204384/comments/default/4851363231533691474'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/for-you-hunters-out-there.html?showComment=1473696319913#c4851363231533691474' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/for-you-hunters-out-there.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5108038412375204384' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/5108038412375204384' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1258196374"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 11:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-733894144627901419</id><published>2016-09-11T10:01:01.098-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-11T10:01:01.098-05:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Never have understood the &amp;quot;braggadocio&amp;...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Never have understood the &amp;quot;braggadocio&amp;quot; so often appearing in these forum when the subject is resisting government.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s called &amp;#39;trash talkin&amp;#39;, my friend. Intended to rattle the opposition and maybe cause them to make unforced errors. Errors like thinking we are just a bunch of loud-mouth rednecks and giving them a false sense of superiority. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But don&amp;#39;t fret. There&amp;#39;s still plenty of room for surprise when the time comes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/51